    "recommendations": "Ensuring the single access point and extended driveway remain clear of parked vehicles and encroaching vegetation could significantly improve apparatus entry and exit during an emergency response. Maintaining visible address markers near the street frontage would support rapid navigation to the property, particularly given the length of the driveway. The unpaved circulation route connecting structures on the property could benefit from periodic attention to surface conditions to support apparatus movement and staging in the open areas near the main and detached structures. Identifying and communicating an alternate staging area along the access road may also support responder operations given the limited side access around the structures."
